 * Description:
 *   Check for media inserted in a slot.  Called (1) during initialization to
 *   see if there was a card in the slot at power up, (2) when/if a media
 *   insertion event occurs, or (3) if the BIOC_PROBE ioctl command is
 *   received.
 *
